---
layout: base.njk
pagination: {data: reports, size: 1, alias: r}
permalink: "/reports/{{ r.date }}/"
ogType: article
eleventyComputed:
  title: "Daily install report {{ r.date }}: {{ r.pass }}/{{ r.total }} agent add-on installs passed"
  desc: "SkillMaxx nightly run {{ r.date }}: {{ r.addons }} skills, plugins and MCP servers really installed in Claude Code, Codex, Grok Build, Cursor and Pi. {{ r.pass }} of {{ r.total }} installs passed{% if r.broke %}, {{ r.broke.length }} newly broke, {{ r.fixed.length }} fixed{% endif %}."
  issueDate: "{{ r.date }}"
---
{% set nlid = "newsletter-top" %}{% set nlh = "Get the weekly scorecard by email" %}{% set nlp = "Daily reports live on the site only, we never email them. The free weekly email (Tuesdays) has the week's install scorecard plus new tools." %}
<div class="wrap prose"><p class="muted"><a href="/reports/">Daily reports</a> › {{ r.date }}</p>
<h1 class="ph">Daily install report: {{ r.date }}</h1>
<p class="answer">On {{ r.date }} we ran the real install of {{ r.addons }} agent add-ons across Claude Code, Codex, Grok Build, Cursor and Pi in a clean sandbox: <b>{{ r.pass }} of {{ r.total }} installs passed</b>, {{ r.fail }} failed.{% if r.prev_date %} Compared with the previous run ({{ r.prev_date }}, {{ r.prev_pass }}/{{ r.prev_total }}): {{ r.fixed.length }} fixed, {{ r.broke.length }} newly broke{% if r.added.length %}, {{ r.added.length }} new add-ons{% endif %}.{% endif %}</p></div>
{% include "nlembed.njk" %}
<div class="wrap prose">
<h2>Pass rate by agent</h2>
<div class="tw"><table class="matrix"><thead><tr><th>Agent</th><th>Installs</th><th>Passed</th><th>Failed</th></tr></thead><tbody>
{% for a in site.agents %}{% if r.by[a] %}<tr><th scope="row">{{ a|agentName }}</th><td>{{ r.by[a].total }}</td><td class="tok">{{ r.by[a].pass }}</td><td>{{ r.by[a].fail }}</td></tr>{% endif %}{% endfor %}</tbody></table></div>
{% if r.standout %}<h2>Standout pick</h2>
<p><a href="/skills/{{ r.standout.slug }}/"><b>{{ r.standout.name }}</b></a>{% if r.standout.why %} ({{ r.standout.why }}){% endif %}: installed cleanly in {{ r.standout.agents.length }} agents ({% for a in r.standout.agents %}{{ a|agentName }}{% if not loop.last %}, {% endif %}{% endfor %}){% if r.standout.stars %}, {{ r.standout.stars | kfmt }} GitHub stars{% endif %}. {{ r.standout.desc }}</p>
<p class="muted">How we pick: passes in the most agents tonight, new and newly fixed add-ons first, then GitHub stars. Never sponsored.</p>{% endif %}
{% if r.broke %}<h2>Newly broke ({{ r.broke.length }})</h2>{% if r.broke.length %}<ul>{% for x in r.broke %}<li><a href="/skills/{{ x.slug }}/">{{ x.name }}</a> in {{ x.agent|agentName }}</li>{% endfor %}</ul>{% else %}<p>Nothing broke since {{ r.prev_date }}.</p>{% endif %}
<h2>Fixed ({{ r.fixed.length }})</h2>{% if r.fixed.length %}<ul>{% for x in r.fixed %}<li><a href="/skills/{{ x.slug }}/">{{ x.name }}</a> in {{ x.agent|agentName }}</li>{% endfor %}</ul>{% else %}<p>No fixes since {{ r.prev_date }}.</p>{% endif %}
<h2>New additions ({{ r.added.length }})</h2>{% if r.added.length %}<ul>{% for x in r.added %}<li><a href="/skills/{{ x.slug }}/">{{ x.name }}</a></li>{% endfor %}</ul>{% else %}<p>No new add-ons since {{ r.prev_date }}.</p>{% endif %}
{% if r.removed.length %}<h2>Dropped from the lists ({{ r.removed.length }})</h2><ul>{% for x in r.removed %}<li>{{ x.name }}</li>{% endfor %}</ul>{% endif %}{% endif %}
<h2>Agent versions tested</h2><ul>{% for a in site.agents %}{% if r.versions[a] %}<li>{{ a|agentName }}: <code>{{ r.versions[a] }}</code></li>{% endif %}{% endfor %}</ul>
<p class="muted">Run started {{ r.run_at }}. Failures often mean an add-on needs an account or API key our keyless sandbox doesn't have; each skill page has the log. <a href="/how-we-test/">How we test</a> · <a href="/reports/">All daily reports</a></p>
</div>
{% set nlid = "newsletter" %}{% set nlh = "Get the weekly scorecard" %}{% set nlp = "" %}
{% include "nlembed.njk" %}
{% set jsonld = {"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Dataset","name":"SkillMaxx install test results " + r.date,"description":desc,"url":site.url + page.url,"datePublished":r.date,"temporalCoverage":r.date,"isAccessibleForFree":true,"license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/","creator":{"@type":"Organization","name":"SkillMaxx","url":site.url + "/"},"keywords":["agent skills","MCP servers","Claude Code","Codex","Grok Build","Cursor","Pi","install tests"],"variableMeasured":["installs tested","installs passed","installs failed","newly broke","fixed","new add-ons"]} %}
{% set jsonld2 = {"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","headline":title,"description":desc,"datePublished":r.date,"dateModified":r.date,"mainEntityOfPage":site.url + page.url,"image":site.url + "/assets/og.png","author":{"@type":"Organization","name":"SkillMaxx"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"SkillMaxx","logo":{"@type":"ImageObject","url":site.url + "/assets/og.png"} } } %}
